cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use iso20022-readiness-suite-mcp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "iso20022-readiness-suite-mcp: Model Context Protocol gateway for ISO 20022 readiness"
abstract: >-
  An orchestration Model Context Protocol server for the ISO 20022 MCP Suite:
  four tools that score a payment message against a clearing profile
  (CBPR+, SEPA_Instant, FedNow, Generic), propose automated remediation
  such as structured postal addresses, and simulate a bank's pacs.002
  response, composing the suite's foundational servers over stdio.
